{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001836833","cik":"0001836833","slug":"planet-labs-pbc-836833","name":"Planet Labs PBC","ticker":"PL","exchanges":["NYSE"],"sector":"Radio & Tv Broadcasting & Communications Equipment","sic":"3663","country":"CA","website":"","listed_years":4.3,"first_annual":"2022-04-14","last_filing":"2026-07-29","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001836833&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["Planet Labs PBC files with the SEC under \"Radio & Tv Broadcasting & Communications Equipment\", based in CA, and has been publicly reporting for 4 years.","It reported $315.1m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 42.1% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 53.5%.","Listed on NYSE, it is still consuming cash, with roughly 2091 months of runway at the current burn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 42.1% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $94.2m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526258304/0001193125-26-258304-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-258304"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526258304/0001193125-26-258304-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-258304"},{"text":"Gross margin of 53.5% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526258304/0001193125-26-258304-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-258304"},{"text":"Net cash of $368.1m against total assets of $1.3bn - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526258304/0001193125-26-258304-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-258304"}],"bear":[{"text":"Gross margin compressed from 55.2% to 53.5% against the same quarter a year earlier. Either input costs are rising or the company is discounting to hold volume.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526258304/0001193125-26-258304-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-258304"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-37.1% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526258304/0001193125-26-258304-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-258304"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $12.1m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526258304/0001193125-26-258304-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-258304"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 15.1% over the year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000119312526258304/0001193125-26-258304-index.htm","accession":"0001193125-26-258304"},{"text":"Insiders disposed of 7.9% of their combined holdings over the last four quarters (454,722 shares across 14 ownership filings). People with the best view of the business were reducing their stake.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000157285426000003/0001572854-26-000003-index.htm"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 1.5% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1836833/000157285426000003/0001572854-26-000003-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Be